        "id": 1042638
      },
      "writtenOn": "2023-05-08T21:26:05Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "This looks shady. Where is the original object it refers to? If it\u0027s one of elements of `mSubmixRoutes` then holding a reference to it is not correct because it\u0027s not constant, and modifying the contents of `mSubmixRoutes` may shift the contents of even re-allocate the vector data to another location making this reference dangling.",
      "range": {
